{
  "_doc": "Cases of the unity module. tier quick|full (--quick runs the quick ones); group: one Unity process per group (static: no Unity); kind: what StandCases.Run does; rule: the rules.json key a violation counts against; needs: capabilities (guard, releaseCheck, toggle22, toggle21: the contract of the package version; profiles, aa, sbp, osxPlayer, il2cppMac: the environment); expect: pass | compiled | blocked (guard, check after the compile or #error) | blocked-guard | blocked-error | ran. Field reference: Template/Assets/KenseiStand/Editor/StandModel.cs (CaseDef).",
